@CatalogAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5187

### ========================================
### 🔍 BUSCA NO ELASTICSEARCH - SEARCH
### ========================================

### 1. Busca simples
GET {{CatalogAPI_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/search/products?q=xiaomi
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Busca com erro de digitação (Fuzzy) - "samsng" encontra "samsung"
GET {{CatalogAPI_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/search/products?q=samsng
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Busca com paginação
GET {{CatalogAPI_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/search/products?q=iphone&page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Busca segunda página
GET {{CatalogAPI_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/search/products?q=iphone&page=2&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Busca com query vazia (retorna erro 400)
GET {{CatalogAPI_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/search/products?q=
Accept: application/json

###

### LEGACY - Weather Forecast
GET {{CatalogAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
